AiTask weekly_category_revenue_tank_alert {
  label: "Weekly Category Revenue Tank Alert"
  description: "Posts categories whose weekly revenue fell 20% or more to Slack."
  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get revenue by product category for the last complete Monday–Sunday week and the preceding complete Monday–Sunday week.
    2. Find every category whose revenue dropped 20% or more week over week.
    3. Write a short alert listing each affected category, revenue in both weeks, and the percentage change. Write the result with the write_ai_task_result skill.

    Delivery: If at least one category dropped 20% or more, post the alert to the Slack channel #nhity-test. Otherwise, send nothing.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week and the preceding complete Monday–Sunday week.
    - Lists every category whose revenue dropped 20% or more, and no others.
    - Sends a Slack alert to #nhity-test only when at least one category meets the threshold.
  ;;
}
